('oxford', 'oxford', 'first', 'p6', 'unit2', 8, 'damage crops', 'dam-age crops', '損毀農作物', '動詞短語 v.', 'The dry weather can damage crops.', '乾旱天氣會損毀農作物。', 'If there is no rain for too long, the heat will damage crops in the fields.', '如果太久沒下雨，高溫就會損毀田裡的農作物。', 'damage crops', 'audio/audio_08.mp3', 'thumb_08.png', '', '{"en": "damage crops", "syllables": "dam-age crops", "zh": "損毀農作物", "pos": "動詞短語 v.", "ex_en": "The dry weather can damage crops.", "ex_zh": "乾旱天氣會損毀農作物。", "adv_en": "If there is no rain for too long, the heat will damage crops in the fields.", "adv_zh": "如果太久沒下雨，高溫就會損毀田裡的農作物。", "highlight": "damage crops", "audio": "audio/audio_08.mp3", "img": "thumb_08.png", "video": ""}'::jsonb, 'published'),
